tellmwm v1.2 - http://fastestcode.org/emwm.html

Usage: tellmwm [<command> <arguments>]
Commands and arguments (see man 1 tellmwm for more info):
	backdrop <workspace ID> [-f <color> -b <color>] [<image name> | none]
	setws    <workspace ID>
	addws    [<title>]
	namews   <workspace ID> <title>
	delws    <workspace ID>
If no command is specified, current configuration will be printed.
